Short:    ABBS util - Search for a file
Author:   Kåre Johansen <kaarej@barentsnett.no>
Uploader: Kåre Johansen <kaarej@barentsnett.no>
Version:  1.15
Type:     Comm/BBS
Requires: OS2.0 or higher, reqtools.library and ABBS ;)
Replaces: Comm/BBS/findcopy.lha

